## The build is Apache-2.0

`src/`, `gates/`, `tools/`, `kagami.config.mjs` and the workflows are ordinary
code, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 in `LICENSE`. Take it, adapt it,
point it at your own mark.

Apache-2.0 was chosen over MIT for section 6, which says in the licence itself
that it grants no trademark rights. That is useful and it is not sufficient, for
the reason the next section now states.

